stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scheduled
    Scheduled --> Running: worker picked task
    Running --> Waiting: timer or external signal
    Waiting --> Running: signal received
    Running --> Retrying: activity failed
    Retrying --> Running: backoff elapsed
    Retrying --> Compensating: retry limit reached
    Compensating --> Failed: compensation recorded
    Running --> Completed: all activities done
    Completed --> [*]
    Failed --> [*]

    state Running {
        [*] --> Validate
        Validate --> Charge
        Charge --> PublishEvent
        PublishEvent --> [*]
    }
